<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title><%= title %> | Monster Index</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include("./partial/redirectHeader") %>
    <main>
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div>
          <h1>Every monster has a story.</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="about-copy">
          <p>
            Monster Book is a simple place to keep the creatures you discover
            along the way.
          </p>
          <p>
            Add their name, level, type, and element—then watch your collection
            grow.
          </p>
          <div class="about-list">
            <div class="about-item">
              <span>01</span><strong>Find a monster</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="about-item">
              <span>02</span><strong>Write down its traits</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="about-item">
              <span>03</span><strong>Grow your collection</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
